          "source_digest": "4ba79ff365417fe2583a7708b55d2aa4600935a3c91bb80870feaf3484c6009c",
          "span_id": "SPN-MCG-003",
          "substantive": true,
          "text": "The model owner submits a change ticket with the affected methodology, model version, reason, and expected impact. The referenced loss methodology has a different name in one paragraph.",
